    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10414" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">con-sarcĭno</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>, ātum, 1, <i>v. a., to sew, stitch</i>, or <i>patch
